# Python book pipeline (not needed for web app) — EXCEPT the specific files
# api/render-book-html.py needs to render a real book_v2 PDF (Create-A-Book).
# This was the actual root cause of a live "ModuleNotFoundError" (2026-08-10):
# vercel.json's per-function includeFiles can only add back files that were
# actually uploaded — it cannot override a repo-wide .vercelignore exclusion,
# which runs first. The "step down, then negate" pattern below is required
# because gitignore-style engines never descend into an already-excluded
# directory to check negations inside it — `!myphonics_books/scripts/x.py`
# alone would silently do nothing while `myphonics_books/` stays excluded.
myphonics_books/*
!myphonics_books/scripts
!myphonics_books/core
!myphonics_books/templates
!myphonics_books/assets
!myphonics_books/data

myphonics_books/scripts/*
!myphonics_books/scripts/generate_book.py
!myphonics_books/scripts/generate_custom_book.py
!myphonics_books/scripts/v2_helpers.py
!myphonics_books/scripts/print_qr.py
!myphonics_books/scripts/audit_tricky_words.py

myphonics_books/assets/*
!myphonics_books/assets/fonts

myphonics_apps/

# Marketing assets
marketing/
marketing-mockups/
remotion-transfer/

# Large generated files
output/
*.pdf
*.wav
*.aup3

# Python
__pycache__/
venv/
.venv/
*.pyc

# Generated audio (kept — pre-generated MP3s needed for interactive books)

# Content pipeline
content/
agents/

# Scratch files
public/comparison.html
phonics-explorer.html
MyPhonicsBooks_Visual_Review_unpacked/
